| Feature | Revert | Fallback | Rollback | Manual install+activate |
|---------|--------|----------|----------|-------------------------|
| **CLI** | `swu revert` | `swu fallback` | No direct CLI | `swu install` + `swu activate` |
| **Scope** | Board/category | Entire NE | Single board/category | Flexible |
| **Needs checkpoint** | No | Yes | No | No |
| **Needs old SW on flash** | Yes (executing) | Yes (checkpoint versions) | Yes (cur) | No (re-download) |
| **Restores ENM spec** | Partial (all boards only) | Yes | No | Manual |
| **Typical use** | Cancel pending activate | Failed full upgrade | Internal recovery | Lab / specific version |

